Package: eloquence
Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${eloquence:Arch-Depends}
Recommends: speech-dispatcher, curl, unzip, python3, python3-venv,
 gcc-arm-linux-gnueabihf | gcc, kmod
Description: Eloquence V6.1 text-to-speech engine
 Runs the ETI Eloquence V6.1 ARM TTS libraries: under QEMU user-mode
 emulation on amd64, natively on armhf and arm64 (Raspberry Pi). Includes
 a command-line tool, a drop-in libeci.so shim library, and a
 speech-dispatcher output module.
 .
 After installation, run 'sudo eloquence-setup' to download and
 configure the Eloquence voice data.
